            "privateNotes": "",
            "publicNotes": "<p>Vedzaxes are the fast attack units of the Krethiskar subcolony. These small, winged components have four legs, each ending in a viciously jagged talon with which they can stab prey and pin them in place. A flock of vedzax often forms the vanguard of a Swarm attack force, swooping in from above to harry and distract targets while slower, more powerful Swarm units move into position.</p><hr /><p>The Krethiskar Swarm has developed new types of Swarm components to further its goals in the Szandite Collective systems.</p>",
